WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough
to split the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.840 --> 01:40.620
Changgeng.

01:42.590 --> 01:44.210
How could I ever forget that name?

01:45.400 --> 01:46.690
All my failures

01:48.280 --> 01:49.620
are all thanks to him.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.130
I want revenge.

01:51.840 --> 01:53.020
I'm going to kill him.

01:54.310 --> 01:56.620
The South Sea battle was very costly.

01:57.790 --> 01:59.460
You haven't recovered yet.

02:00.310 --> 02:02.290
Just rest and recuperate for now.

02:02.430 --> 02:03.290
As for other things,

02:04.480 --> 02:06.100
pay them no mind.

02:11.750 --> 02:12.540
Right.

02:14.470 --> 02:15.500
Pay no mind.

02:17.080 --> 02:18.100
Pay no mind.

02:19.470 --> 02:20.500
Pay no mind.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.500
Master Jin Chan,

02:28.310 --> 02:29.500
about the Sea Deity Sect...

02:35.590 --> 02:37.410
Ao Yi returning to the Dragon Palace now

02:38.710 --> 02:40.100
is no coincidence.

02:42.310 --> 02:43.890
It's Changgeng's scheme.

02:45.310 --> 02:47.500
He's here to avenge the Ascendance Sect.

02:48.430 --> 02:50.290
Pity our Crown Prince

02:51.310 --> 02:53.890
has been so restless lately,

02:54.280 --> 02:55.500
unfit for big tasks.

02:55.910 --> 02:57.690
His downfall came from two events:

02:58.870 --> 03:00.690
Jiang Si'er leaving him,

03:01.080 --> 03:02.890
and his defeat in the South Sea.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.410
Both were caused

03:05.240 --> 03:06.820
by Changgeng.

03:07.800 --> 03:09.450
Master, you mean...

03:13.240 --> 03:15.100
He saw through our scheme,

03:16.310 --> 03:18.100
so he wants to ruin First Prince,

03:19.120 --> 03:20.610
support Ao Yi,

03:21.240 --> 03:22.730
and crush our plot.

03:23.840 --> 03:25.500
That despicable Changgeng.

03:27.590 --> 03:29.290
Now the Crown Prince is useless.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.060
Westdawn's grand plot

03:31.470 --> 03:33.220
probably can't rely on him.

03:34.080 --> 03:35.100
How about we...

03:43.000 --> 03:44.220
The First Prince

03:44.840 --> 03:46.890
is a pawn we planted long ago.

03:47.310 --> 03:49.010
Can't abandon him easily.

04:00.630 --> 04:03.060
Changgeng can ruin my pawn,

04:04.310 --> 04:07.290
so why can't I ruin his?

04:10.940 --> 04:13.780
[Episode 23]

05:05.720 --> 05:06.490
Senior.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.700
Here.

05:10.160 --> 05:12.370
I gathered all kinds of herbs

05:12.390 --> 05:14.100
and made this sachet for you.

05:15.360 --> 05:17.140
Sniff it now and then.

05:18.630 --> 05:19.660
Thanks, Senior.

05:24.040 --> 05:24.810
How is it?

05:25.360 --> 05:26.050
Seems like

05:26.800 --> 05:27.930
I really can smell it.

05:29.040 --> 05:30.020
Liar.

05:31.920 --> 05:32.850
Just remember,

05:33.160 --> 05:35.020
you belong to Turtle Island now.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.810
If anyone outside picks on you,

05:36.830 --> 05:37.610
don't worry.

05:37.830 --> 05:39.540
I will teach them a lesson for you.

05:44.390 --> 05:46.810
Once I revive the Dragon Clan
and rule the East Sea,

05:47.920 --> 05:49.250
I will find you.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.460
Whatever the Dragon Clan owes you,

05:54.750 --> 05:55.850
I'll repay my debt to you

05:57.190 --> 05:58.580
a hundred times over.

06:03.070 --> 06:03.850
Who's there?

06:07.870 --> 06:08.610
Please rise.

06:08.630 --> 06:09.370
Please rise.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.850
Why are you still here?

06:13.430 --> 06:15.540
We came to bring you fresh clothes.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.930
We thought we'd help you change.

06:17.120 --> 06:18.540
You don't need to do that anymore.

06:18.560 --> 06:20.250
I can wash and dress by myself.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.170
Well...

06:22.190 --> 06:22.980
You may go back.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.410
Yes.

06:39.830 --> 06:40.730
Please show me the way.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.170
Senior is such a big perv.

06:53.190 --> 06:54.780
He sees a beautiful fairy and he...

06:55.360 --> 06:56.290
Oops.

06:56.360 --> 06:56.980
Lan Ling'e.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.460
Don't talk about Senior like that.

06:59.120 --> 07:01.020
Since he has gone astray,

07:01.040 --> 07:03.610
I must be his guiding light.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.660
I'm coming.

07:08.720 --> 07:09.490
Senior.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.340
Senior.

07:12.750 --> 07:13.540
Senior.

07:14.240 --> 07:15.860
Senior, where are you?

07:15.920 --> 07:16.700
Senior.

07:20.640 --> 07:23.570
Senior, where are you?

07:24.160 --> 07:26.380
Is it because my legs are too short?

07:26.640 --> 07:28.410
Senior. Senior.

07:28.640 --> 07:31.490
No, my legs are pretty long.

07:32.160 --> 07:34.010
Senior, you left no footprints.

07:34.030 --> 07:35.300
Senior.

07:37.230 --> 07:38.140
What to do?

07:40.070 --> 07:40.700
Not bad.

07:42.240 --> 07:43.020
Jiu...

07:43.160 --> 07:43.930
Ling'e.

07:44.430 --> 07:45.930
Seems Changshou

07:45.950 --> 07:48.050
quietly set up a formation here.

07:48.240 --> 07:49.290
Aunt, why are you here?

07:49.310 --> 07:50.610
As expected of Senior Changshou.

07:50.830 --> 07:52.340
Even predicted us tailing him.

07:52.360 --> 07:54.170
Changshou is such a big perv.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.780
When he sees a lovely fairy...

07:55.800 --> 07:56.900
- Exactly.
- No.

07:56.920 --> 07:59.170
He was bewitched and led astray.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.980
Grandlord entrusted me
with a heavy duty.

08:02.040 --> 08:03.340
I must protect everyone.

08:03.390 --> 08:04.020
This time,

08:04.240 --> 08:06.140
let me be a guiding light

08:06.160 --> 08:07.370
to protect Senior Changshou.

08:07.750 --> 08:09.170
You two were eavesdropping on me.

08:09.430 --> 08:10.540
What did you say?

08:10.720 --> 08:12.340
We all came for Senior,

08:12.360 --> 08:13.780
so our hearts must be aligned.

08:13.800 --> 08:15.980
Too bad Changshou outsmarted us.

08:16.480 --> 08:18.780
Looks like we can't stop him today.

08:18.800 --> 08:21.100
Protecting Senior is our duty.

08:21.120 --> 08:21.900
Well said.

08:24.800 --> 08:25.610
Starting today,

08:25.920 --> 08:28.020
our Changshou's Guardian Trio

08:28.160 --> 08:29.050
is officially formed.

08:29.160 --> 08:30.850
Exactly, we're gonna split them...

08:30.920 --> 08:32.820
No. Protect Senior.

08:33.670 --> 08:34.180
Who's over there?

08:34.600 --> 08:35.100
Hide.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.370
Yunxiao.

08:51.870 --> 08:53.060
Yunxiao.

08:56.750 --> 08:58.220
Yunxiao.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.940
Why are you here?

09:02.440 --> 09:03.610
Let me tell you,

09:03.910 --> 09:06.060
never act recklessly.

09:06.510 --> 09:07.820
If you ruin the grand plan,

09:08.150 --> 09:10.060
the consequences will be...

09:15.030 --> 09:16.940
Good evening, Yunxiao.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.730
Well, I...

09:18.960 --> 09:20.610
The Dragon Palace is huge.

09:20.630 --> 09:21.820
Hard to find the restroom.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.490
Stop right there.

09:24.120 --> 09:25.010
Who are you?

09:25.600 --> 09:26.580
Do I know you?

09:27.120 --> 09:29.370
A low-tier human disciple like you,

09:29.510 --> 09:31.650
visiting me late at night,
what do you want?

09:32.120 --> 09:33.850
Wanting to steal a few spell lessons,

09:34.030 --> 09:35.370
or fishing for romance?

09:35.390 --> 09:35.890
No, I...

09:35.910 --> 09:37.820
Even a brat like you from the Human Clan

09:37.960 --> 09:39.340
can be a cultivator?

09:39.630 --> 09:41.610
You dare say our Seizing Sect
recruits recklessly?

09:41.630 --> 09:43.530
If it weren't for the Dragon Palace,

09:43.790 --> 09:45.420
I'd teach you a lesson for sure.

09:45.440 --> 09:46.220
Get lost.

09:47.240 --> 09:48.420
Yes, yes.

09:49.320 --> 09:50.370
Sorry to disturb you.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.420
Dear friends,

09:54.270 --> 09:55.770
His Majesty has ordered

09:56.000 --> 09:58.610
that you eat and drink well today.

09:58.840 --> 10:00.060
You must enjoy yourselves.

10:00.360 --> 10:01.940
I, Turtle, will raise a toast first.

10:03.150 --> 10:03.900
Take a bite.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.640
Fill it up for me.

10:09.120 --> 10:10.730
What is Yunxiao...

10:10.750 --> 10:12.010
Aunt. Senior.

10:13.080 --> 10:13.650
Junior.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.010
Senior.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.820
I quit drinking. You go ahead.

10:17.200 --> 10:17.980
Okay.

10:21.790 --> 10:23.010
Where are you going?

10:23.240 --> 10:24.420
Off to work.

10:25.240 --> 10:26.010
Work?

10:26.720 --> 10:27.610
What for?

10:27.630 --> 10:29.700
Our Sea Deity Sect loves working.

10:29.720 --> 10:32.420
Work brings joy. All together now.

10:38.600 --> 10:42.820
Bear Island is so great.
We love Bear Island.

10:42.840 --> 10:46.610
Listen to the deity.
And we'll live forever.

10:51.600 --> 10:52.300
Let's go.

10:53.240 --> 10:53.890
Alright.

10:53.910 --> 10:54.530
Come on.

10:55.080 --> 10:55.580
Make way.

10:59.960 --> 11:00.730
What are you doing?

11:00.750 --> 11:01.580
Working.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.370
Are you crazy?

11:06.240 --> 11:07.010
Right.

11:07.840 --> 11:10.220
Where am I going with them?

11:13.200 --> 11:15.130
The Sea Deity Sect's brainwashing

11:15.390 --> 11:16.610
is way too strong.

11:20.600 --> 11:21.730
We gotta be careful.

11:22.840 --> 11:23.700
High immortal.

11:27.440 --> 11:28.220
High immortal.

11:28.870 --> 11:29.650
High immortal?

11:31.960 --> 11:32.730
High immortal!

11:33.550 --> 11:34.370
Calling me?

11:35.030 --> 11:35.770
High immortal.

11:36.550 --> 11:38.010
Let's have a drink.

11:38.030 --> 11:38.770
Bottoms up.

11:38.790 --> 11:39.770
Let's drink to...

11:41.840 --> 11:43.300
Oh my.

11:44.000 --> 11:45.060
So blunt?

11:46.670 --> 11:48.770
Who did the Celestial Court send?

11:50.240 --> 11:51.940
Could it be the Immortal of Wine?

11:51.960 --> 11:52.650
Your Majesty.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.460
I don't think there's such post.

11:55.480 --> 11:57.820
Right. No such position.

11:57.870 --> 11:58.650
Let me ask.

12:00.440 --> 12:01.370
High immortal.

12:02.440 --> 12:05.370
In the Celestial Court,
what's your post?

12:05.390 --> 12:06.730
Changshou, what should I say?

12:06.750 --> 12:08.250
What position exactly?

12:08.750 --> 12:11.220
Tell the truth.

12:16.200 --> 12:18.610
High immortal, what's your position?

12:19.840 --> 12:20.980
Seems hard of hearing.

12:21.720 --> 12:22.650
Your Majesty.

12:22.790 --> 12:26.180
I serve in the Marriage Division,

12:26.240 --> 12:27.980
managing Three Realms marriages,

12:28.000 --> 12:29.980
known to people

12:30.000 --> 12:30.890
as Moon Elder.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.850
Moon Elder?

12:32.150 --> 12:33.580
Moon Elder.

12:34.890 --> 12:35.530
Moon Elder.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.980
Could you tie a red thread for me?

12:37.000 --> 12:38.370
Just one is enough, please.

12:38.840 --> 12:41.460
Me first.

12:42.030 --> 12:42.730
I was here first.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.010
I was here first.

12:44.030 --> 12:45.530
One at a time.

12:45.550 --> 12:45.940
Everyone gets a match.

12:45.960 --> 12:48.010
Enough!

12:48.720 --> 12:50.010
How do I usually teach you?

12:50.910 --> 12:52.420
Over a bit of personal romance,

12:53.200 --> 12:54.420
you've shamed our Dragon Palace

12:54.630 --> 12:56.340
before the Celestial Immortal.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.010
Get out.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.100
Get out.

12:58.840 --> 13:00.420
Shrimps can't get married.

13:00.440 --> 13:01.130
Alright?

13:03.120 --> 13:04.730
Shrimps can't, but dragons can.

13:08.200 --> 13:10.010
Moon Elder, I'm truly sorry.

13:10.030 --> 13:11.220
Excuse the embarrassment.

13:11.630 --> 13:14.100
On their behalf, I apologize to you.

13:14.120 --> 13:14.980
No need for that.

13:15.000 --> 13:17.010
Let's share an arm-crossed...

13:18.030 --> 13:19.940
No, a heart-to-heart drink.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.370
Moon Elder,

13:25.120 --> 13:26.770
I wanna get a few more concubines.

13:26.790 --> 13:28.010
What do you say?

13:28.440 --> 13:30.340
Dragon King, you're so...

13:31.320 --> 13:32.340
So vigorous.

13:34.200 --> 13:35.180
This is outrageous.

13:37.630 --> 13:39.010
Our East Sea Dragon Clan

13:40.080 --> 13:41.420
is the head of dragons,

13:41.550 --> 13:43.220
master of the Four Seas.

13:44.750 --> 13:46.370
The envoy the Celestial Court sent

13:46.550 --> 13:48.850
is just a petty marriage clerk.

13:48.870 --> 13:49.610
What?

13:51.510 --> 13:52.650
Looking down on us?

13:52.790 --> 13:53.650
Don't get angry.

13:53.960 --> 13:56.730
Jia, why such a temper?

13:56.750 --> 13:59.220
Since the Celestial Court
sent this high immortal here,

13:59.240 --> 14:00.010
that means

14:00.030 --> 14:01.610
it hasn't forgotten our Dragon Clan.

14:01.630 --> 14:02.340
That's a good thing.

14:02.360 --> 14:02.730
Yeah.

14:02.750 --> 14:04.250
Why so angry? Come on.

14:04.510 --> 14:06.250
Father, you are mistaken.

14:06.510 --> 14:08.490
If the Celestial Court truly valued us,

14:08.510 --> 14:10.370
they'd send a mighty general

14:10.440 --> 14:12.610
to spar with our warriors.

14:12.750 --> 14:14.060
If he truly has the skill,

14:14.360 --> 14:16.010
we'd naturally be convinced.

14:16.320 --> 14:16.980
But now,

14:17.270 --> 14:18.980
sending a mere Moon Elder?

14:19.390 --> 14:21.180
May I ask what power you have?

14:21.750 --> 14:23.730
What stage are you cultivated to?

14:27.030 --> 14:28.420
The liquor's gone cold.

14:28.960 --> 14:32.130
Jia makes a point.

14:32.150 --> 14:32.530
It's gone cold.

14:32.550 --> 14:33.220
No, wait.

14:33.600 --> 14:36.060
Since you're a Deity from heaven,

14:36.440 --> 14:39.130
you must know some magical power.

14:39.240 --> 14:41.460
Show us a trick for everyone to see.

14:41.720 --> 14:42.820
I only tie threads.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.530
Well,

14:43.750 --> 14:46.130
I, Ao Jia, Crown Prince
of the Dragon Palace,

14:47.360 --> 14:49.820
would be honored
to amuse the high immortal.

14:50.840 --> 14:51.610
Please.

14:51.720 --> 14:53.650
Switching from drinking to fighting?

14:54.270 --> 14:54.530
What?

14:54.550 --> 14:55.180
I'm not...

14:55.510 --> 14:56.060
Scared?

14:56.360 --> 14:58.130
I'm scared? I...

14:58.240 --> 14:58.730
Father.

14:58.910 --> 14:59.610
I have something to report.

14:59.630 --> 15:00.340
Tell me later.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.460
Moon Elder came this time

15:01.790 --> 15:03.100
precisely because

15:03.550 --> 15:04.820
the Celestial Court
granted me a marriage.

15:06.150 --> 15:07.580
Little Prince is getting married?

15:08.360 --> 15:09.460
Congratulations.

15:09.600 --> 15:11.220
Yi, such a huge matter,

15:11.240 --> 15:13.180
why didn't you tell me earlier?

15:13.320 --> 15:14.700
Which lady is it?

15:14.720 --> 15:17.770
Can she match East Sea's Second Prince?

15:18.750 --> 15:19.580
Father.

15:20.030 --> 15:20.730
She is...

15:25.790 --> 15:28.420
Speak up. Who is it?

15:28.750 --> 15:30.340
Mermaid Princess Jiang Si'er.

15:30.360 --> 15:31.460
By Celestial Emperor's decree,

15:31.480 --> 15:33.980
I am willing to marry Ao Yi.

15:35.720 --> 15:36.490
You?

15:39.440 --> 15:40.340
Get married?

15:41.270 --> 15:42.060
That's right.

15:42.080 --> 15:42.850
But...

15:44.240 --> 15:45.730
Why make me get married?

15:46.390 --> 15:47.820
Because you must lead the East Sea

15:47.840 --> 15:48.700
to manage the Forbidden Land.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.370
Managing forbidden land
lets you fight the Westdawn Sect.

15:50.390 --> 15:51.130
Fighting the Westdawn Sect

15:51.150 --> 15:52.490
requires leading the East Sea,

15:52.510 --> 15:54.610
and replacing your brother Ao Jia.

15:54.720 --> 15:55.420
So...

15:55.440 --> 15:56.130
So,

15:56.960 --> 15:58.420
you want me to marry Si'er?

15:58.440 --> 15:59.220
Exactly.

15:59.240 --> 16:00.650
If it can stop the Great Tribulation,

16:02.320 --> 16:03.220
I can accept that.

16:04.360 --> 16:05.250
No way.

16:05.910 --> 16:08.180
I always take Si'er as my sister-in-law.

16:08.200 --> 16:10.530
How can I marry her?

16:10.720 --> 16:12.010
Kings of East Sea Dragon Clan

16:12.030 --> 16:13.490
historically intermarry with Mermaids

16:13.510 --> 16:15.220
to secure our support.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.220
This is strategy.

16:16.320 --> 16:17.100
So,

16:18.750 --> 16:19.730
I can accept it.

16:33.390 --> 16:35.060
Your Highness, you said

16:35.440 --> 16:37.370
if Changgeng asked a favor,

16:37.390 --> 16:39.420
you'd complete the mission he gave you.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.130
Right?

16:41.750 --> 16:42.700
I did say that.

16:42.720 --> 16:43.610
So you came to ask for my advice

16:43.630 --> 16:45.130
because of the mission

16:45.150 --> 16:46.820
Changgeng gave you,

16:46.840 --> 16:47.610
didn't you?

16:48.440 --> 16:49.980
You do have good ideas, but...

16:50.000 --> 16:51.730
Your returning this time

16:51.750 --> 16:53.100
is for the Great Tribulation,

16:53.120 --> 16:54.610
allowing zero room for error.

16:54.670 --> 16:55.460
For the Three Realms,

16:55.480 --> 16:57.610
and to fulfill Changgeng's mission,

16:57.630 --> 17:00.220
can't you just sacrifice a tiny bit?

17:00.240 --> 17:01.220
Can't you?

17:01.440 --> 17:03.530
I promise it'll be a fake marriage.

17:03.550 --> 17:05.900
Nothing intimate will ever happen.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.330
How's that?

17:26.680 --> 17:28.010
Are you hot?

17:28.350 --> 17:30.810
No, I'm just feeling thrilled.

17:30.830 --> 17:31.730
Because we discussed some

17:31.750 --> 17:33.490
rather embarrassing topics.

17:34.680 --> 17:35.490
Li Changshou.

17:36.440 --> 17:37.620
If I agree to this,

17:38.240 --> 17:40.180
can you help me find my Senior?

17:41.590 --> 17:42.700
Of course.

17:42.880 --> 17:45.420
Once you become King of East Sea,

17:45.440 --> 17:46.420
and with the Celestial Court's help,

17:46.440 --> 17:48.570
finding someone will be effortless.

17:51.070 --> 17:51.810
What did you say?

17:53.240 --> 17:53.810
Jia.

17:54.240 --> 17:56.330
Quiet. I haven't asked her yet.

17:56.350 --> 17:57.090
Father.

17:57.680 --> 18:00.290
Jiang Si'er broke an engagement once.

18:00.830 --> 18:02.620
And it was you who decreed

18:02.680 --> 18:04.330
that Dragon and Mermaid Clans cut ties.

18:04.480 --> 18:06.250
The East Sea is the head
of the Four Seas.

18:06.270 --> 18:08.810
How can she just leave at will

18:09.030 --> 18:10.090
and return whenever she pleases?

18:12.000 --> 18:12.860
Dragon King.

18:13.480 --> 18:14.290
Here's the deal.

18:14.480 --> 18:16.330
In the Celestial Court,

18:16.350 --> 18:18.220
I oversee all marriages
in the Three Realms.

18:18.550 --> 18:19.940
I've come this time

18:19.960 --> 18:22.380
to make this marriage happen.

18:22.640 --> 18:25.050
To show the Celestial Court's sincerity,

18:25.070 --> 18:28.620
we've prepared a generous gift.

18:29.920 --> 18:30.660
Here you go.

18:31.640 --> 18:32.810
Void Retrieval?

18:33.240 --> 18:34.010
Impressive.

18:34.550 --> 18:35.810
Senior.

18:36.680 --> 18:38.380
You used your spell.

18:38.790 --> 18:41.420
In the Primordial Era's Witch-Demon War,

18:42.030 --> 18:44.860
the Ancestral Witch heirs used the blood

18:45.070 --> 18:46.700
of their ancestors to forge a sword.

18:47.160 --> 18:48.050
It was called

18:48.510 --> 18:50.620
the Pregenesis Sword.

18:53.200 --> 18:55.570
In the Deity-Demon War 1,000 years ago,

18:56.030 --> 18:58.810
the Demon Emperor got his hands on it.

18:59.480 --> 19:01.530
Relying on this Pregenesis Sword,

19:01.550 --> 19:04.380
he drenched the Three Realms in blood.

19:05.200 --> 19:08.180
It counters magic, but not Demonic Arts.

19:08.270 --> 19:10.050
That's how the Demon Emperor

19:10.070 --> 19:12.010
tore through the Three Realms.

19:12.030 --> 19:13.700
You really know it well.

19:14.440 --> 19:17.980
But sadly, the sword was split in three.

19:18.400 --> 19:19.770
What I hold in my hand

19:19.790 --> 19:22.330
is one of those three pieces.

19:25.640 --> 19:26.570
Yes, exactly.

19:27.440 --> 19:28.530
This is Pregenesis Sword.

19:28.550 --> 19:30.250
I recognize it.

19:30.270 --> 19:32.010
If you agree

19:32.070 --> 19:35.330
to let Ao Yi and Jiang Si'er

19:35.350 --> 19:36.810
marry within three days,

19:36.830 --> 19:39.530
Celestial Court is willing to give you

19:39.790 --> 19:40.980
the fragment

19:41.270 --> 19:42.290
as a gesture of our sincerity.

19:44.160 --> 19:45.220
Are these words true?

19:45.640 --> 19:49.010
Absolutely true.

19:52.480 --> 19:53.250
Good.

20:01.110 --> 20:01.900
Yi.

20:02.640 --> 20:04.730
Do you two really wish to marry?

20:04.750 --> 20:05.460
Father.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.380
Father.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.140
I do.

20:13.030 --> 20:14.810
I do too.

20:14.830 --> 20:15.620
Done.

20:17.310 --> 20:18.810
Turtle Minister, come on, drink.

20:18.830 --> 20:19.530
Come. Sit here.

20:19.550 --> 20:20.290
Come on.

20:20.920 --> 20:21.420
Come.

20:21.590 --> 20:22.420
Perfect. Come on.

20:22.440 --> 20:22.900
Come on.

20:25.830 --> 20:26.730
Jiang Si'er.

20:29.440 --> 20:31.290
You're driving a wedge
between us brothers.

20:31.590 --> 20:33.180
What do you take East Sea for?

20:33.270 --> 20:34.900
What do you take me for?

20:35.030 --> 20:36.380
I just recognized

20:36.960 --> 20:38.220
who's weak inside,

20:39.550 --> 20:40.940
and who's a true hero.

20:42.440 --> 20:43.290
How dare you?

20:49.510 --> 20:50.290
Please.

20:53.240 --> 20:54.010
You want

20:56.030 --> 20:57.140
to fight me?

20:58.830 --> 20:59.620
Brother,

21:01.510 --> 21:02.810
Si'er

21:03.400 --> 21:04.700
is my betrothed.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.250
I can't let you hurt her.

21:11.590 --> 21:12.660
Si'er?

21:15.790 --> 21:16.810
Betrothed?

21:20.310 --> 21:21.290
Si'er?

21:22.270 --> 21:23.380
Betrothed?

21:25.680 --> 21:28.290
Fine. If you mean to wed,

21:30.030 --> 21:31.570
defeat me first.

21:36.440 --> 21:37.810
To lead the Dragon Clan,

21:38.000 --> 21:39.810
you must defeat your brother.

21:52.880 --> 21:53.460
Brother.

21:54.550 --> 21:55.570
For the Dragon Clan.

21:56.440 --> 21:57.570
I must win.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.330
Enough talk.

22:00.640 --> 22:01.490
Just fight.

22:10.240 --> 22:10.810
Surrender.

22:18.400 --> 22:19.420
Growing up,

22:19.750 --> 22:21.220
when have you ever beaten me?

22:21.750 --> 22:23.700
Senior, you're still not acting?

22:23.960 --> 22:24.900
No need.

22:26.200 --> 22:27.620
But Little Prince is gonna lose.

22:28.880 --> 22:30.180
Let's keep watching.

22:42.830 --> 22:43.770
I'm sorry.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.330
I can't lose.

22:52.640 --> 22:54.010
Dragon Flow.

23:30.960 --> 23:32.490
How did you spot my true form?

23:33.440 --> 23:35.090
Your power is indeed strong,

23:35.480 --> 23:37.620
but compared to opponents
I met in the Mortal Realm,

23:37.830 --> 23:38.660
you still fall short.

23:55.640 --> 23:56.290
Senior.

23:56.750 --> 23:58.010
I will protect you.

23:59.480 --> 24:02.220
Ao Yi absorbed
Cloudlink Hermit's Resonance,

24:02.440 --> 24:03.940
gaining at least
1,000 years of spiritual power.

24:04.070 --> 24:05.730
Plus his Dragon's Prophecy,

24:05.830 --> 24:07.980
he now has Aureate Immortal strength.

24:08.070 --> 24:09.330
Ao Jia is no match.

24:16.920 --> 24:17.700
No.

24:18.720 --> 24:19.490
This won't do.

24:21.240 --> 24:21.940
Let's try again.

24:34.640 --> 24:35.420
Ao Jia.

24:36.830 --> 24:38.420
We are blood brothers.

24:38.880 --> 24:39.980
To restore the Dragon Clan,

24:41.070 --> 24:42.420
I need your help.

24:44.550 --> 24:45.180
Brother.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.380
Join me in restoring the Dragon Clan.

24:47.790 --> 24:48.290
Alright?

25:18.240 --> 25:21.810
Blood bonds and affection
are all illusions.

25:51.440 --> 25:52.220
What's wrong?

25:52.880 --> 25:56.940
All is nothingness. All arts void.

26:07.160 --> 26:08.700
Shielding Formation. Open.

26:21.830 --> 26:22.620
Blood Gnat.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.140
Paper butterflies.

26:24.590 --> 26:25.620
Transformation.

26:25.920 --> 26:27.010
Formation.

26:28.680 --> 26:29.980
These moves,

26:30.350 --> 26:31.980
I've seen them all.

26:33.830 --> 26:36.220
Think I wouldn't be prepared?

26:37.830 --> 26:39.010
Changgeng.

27:00.240 --> 27:00.700
Brother.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.050
What's wrong?

27:02.480 --> 27:02.940
Brother.

27:04.590 --> 27:05.050
Brother.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.090
Brother.

27:18.640 --> 27:19.570
Jiang Si'er.

27:20.240 --> 27:22.180
Now I'll show you

27:22.270 --> 27:25.620
who rules the East Sea.

27:27.640 --> 27:29.010
Transform into a dragon.

27:40.640 --> 27:42.180
You can't transform here.

27:43.070 --> 27:44.330
Drink up.

27:45.750 --> 27:46.380
Drink.

27:54.030 --> 27:55.010
Transform into a dragon.

28:16.640 --> 28:18.380
Why doesn't he transform into a dragon?

28:24.750 --> 28:26.010
It's not that he doesn't want to.

28:26.680 --> 28:27.620
He just can't.

28:28.160 --> 28:28.940
He can't?

28:29.200 --> 28:30.380
Have you ever wondered

28:30.480 --> 28:32.420
why he grew so slowly

28:32.590 --> 28:34.220
after years in the Dragon Palace?

28:34.790 --> 28:36.620
Someone restrains him?

28:51.510 --> 28:51.980
Junior.

28:52.550 --> 28:53.620
I have a task for you.

28:53.720 --> 28:54.290
What?

28:54.550 --> 28:56.090
Later, stir up trouble back there.

28:56.110 --> 28:57.050
The bigger the better.

28:58.270 --> 28:59.530
How do I do that?

28:59.550 --> 29:00.730
Do whatever you want.

29:00.750 --> 29:01.380
Go now.

29:01.400 --> 29:01.900
Alright.

29:10.200 --> 29:10.860
Me.

29:18.510 --> 29:19.140
Who?

29:19.270 --> 29:20.090
Who is it?

29:22.790 --> 29:23.730
Let's celebrate.

29:25.790 --> 29:26.490
My goodness.

29:28.550 --> 29:29.330
Impressive.

29:43.920 --> 29:46.770
Voidcity agreed
to go to Blood Sea and save your clan.

29:48.110 --> 29:48.940
Cultivator.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.380
What's wrong?

30:08.160 --> 30:09.220
Cultivator Wen Jing.

30:10.240 --> 30:11.330
What is it?

30:19.440 --> 30:20.980
I was defeated by Changgeng.

30:46.510 --> 30:47.980
Transform into a dragon, now.

30:49.830 --> 30:50.770
I can't do it.

30:50.960 --> 30:52.380
You are ready now.

30:53.790 --> 30:54.380
Your Highness.

30:54.680 --> 30:56.380
Ao Jia using his dragon form against you

30:56.400 --> 30:57.730
already disregards brotherly affection.

30:57.750 --> 30:58.770
Since he treats you like this,

30:58.790 --> 31:00.700
why bother showing him mercy?

31:01.440 --> 31:02.330
Nice assist.

31:08.510 --> 31:11.220
Transform into a dragon!

31:22.270 --> 31:23.490
Ancestral Dragon?

32:37.440 --> 32:38.620
Ao Yi?

32:39.070 --> 32:40.090
It was you?

32:54.480 --> 32:54.980
Brother.

32:56.400 --> 32:57.250
I won.

33:04.240 --> 33:04.730
Ao Jia,

33:05.000 --> 33:07.140
using your dragon form
to sneak-attack your brother,

33:07.400 --> 33:08.490
so ruthless and heartless,

33:08.510 --> 33:09.570
how do you deserve to rule the East Sea?

33:09.590 --> 33:10.290
I didn't.

33:11.030 --> 33:12.140
Just now I...

33:19.310 --> 33:19.730
I...

33:23.310 --> 33:24.140
I lost.

33:27.070 --> 33:28.050
A deal's a deal.

33:29.400 --> 33:30.490
A deal's a deal, right?

33:32.270 --> 33:33.180
I wish you two

33:34.110 --> 33:35.090
love and happiness.

33:41.000 --> 33:41.770
Brother.

33:43.270 --> 33:44.010
Brother.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.980
In that case,

33:56.510 --> 33:57.860
no one objects

33:57.880 --> 34:00.530
to the marriage

34:02.590 --> 34:03.570
between Ao Yi and Jiang Si'er, right?

34:07.720 --> 34:08.690
Good.

34:09.320 --> 34:10.300
Three days later,

34:10.320 --> 34:13.050
we'll hold the wedding ceremony.

34:13.480 --> 34:16.050
Turtle Minister, hurry and prepare.

34:16.070 --> 34:16.900
Yes.

34:17.280 --> 34:19.130
Congratulations, Dragon King.

34:30.510 --> 34:31.300
Attendant.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.420
The jug is empty.

34:32.440 --> 34:33.300
Bring another jug.

34:49.800 --> 34:52.300
I showed him mercy today,

34:52.590 --> 34:54.210
but he fought me to the death.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.900
If he weren't my brother,

34:55.920 --> 34:57.300
I wouldn't have lost.

34:57.670 --> 35:00.050
Indeed, the First Prince held back.

35:00.150 --> 35:01.860
Little Prince is being unreasonable.

35:02.230 --> 35:02.900
Right.

35:04.150 --> 35:04.980
Golden dragon.

35:07.190 --> 35:08.340
The golden dragon we encountered

35:08.920 --> 35:10.340
in the South Sea that day

35:11.360 --> 35:12.780
was actually Ao Yi.

35:12.800 --> 35:14.490
You were sneak-attacked then,

35:14.510 --> 35:15.570
unrecovered from severe wounds,

35:15.800 --> 35:17.260
that's why Little Prince

35:17.280 --> 35:18.740
had a chance today.

35:20.590 --> 35:22.260
Have you ever considered

35:22.710 --> 35:24.210
that the South Sea matter

35:24.480 --> 35:25.780
was also a scheme?

35:28.510 --> 35:29.860
Ao Yi is my brother.

35:30.320 --> 35:31.420
What scheme could there be?

35:31.710 --> 35:33.690
If that golden dragon was his true form,

35:34.510 --> 35:35.860
why didn't he reveal himself to you

35:36.710 --> 35:38.900
when you were in the South Sea?

35:40.280 --> 35:41.380
Well, maybe it's because...

35:48.710 --> 35:49.490
Right.

35:49.590 --> 35:52.460
Ever since Changgeng appeared,

35:53.670 --> 35:56.170
the Little Prince
has stopped obeying you.

35:56.550 --> 35:59.260
He left the East Sea
without permission to train,

35:59.550 --> 36:02.570
transformed into a dragon
and attacked you, leaving you wounded.

36:03.440 --> 36:05.610
And now, while you're still recovering,

36:06.590 --> 36:08.090
he defeated you in front of everyone.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.090
Right.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.010
A scheme.

36:15.800 --> 36:17.980
He had long coveted your place.

36:19.070 --> 36:20.900
So he joined forces with Changgeng

36:21.510 --> 36:22.980
to take what you love

36:23.630 --> 36:25.130
and wound your spirit.

36:25.670 --> 36:27.460
He is no longer your brother.

36:28.670 --> 36:29.530
He is

36:30.230 --> 36:31.820
your enemy.

36:33.190 --> 36:33.940
Right.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.420
Right.

36:38.280 --> 36:39.010
Ao Yi

36:41.360 --> 36:42.820
is my enemy.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.380
Ao Yi

36:47.030 --> 36:47.860
is my...

36:54.190 --> 36:55.530
You'll always be my brother.

36:56.230 --> 36:57.690
Join me in restoring the Dragon Clan.

36:57.960 --> 36:58.740
Alright?

37:09.440 --> 37:10.340
No.

37:12.000 --> 37:13.260
Ao Yi is not my enemy.

37:17.190 --> 37:19.010
Ao Yi is my brother.

37:24.400 --> 37:26.050
First Prince, you've worked hard today.

37:27.150 --> 37:28.420
Get some rest.

37:32.630 --> 37:33.740
Master Jin Chan.

37:34.590 --> 37:35.420
You...

37:39.550 --> 37:41.010
This pawn is useless now.

37:42.110 --> 37:43.300
Take him to the East Palace.

37:44.510 --> 37:47.530
Lock him in his room and keep him there.

37:48.110 --> 37:49.490
Master, you mean,

37:50.320 --> 37:51.530
confine the First Prince?

37:51.710 --> 37:53.490
Killing him is too much trouble.

37:56.360 --> 37:57.900
Well played, Changgeng.

37:59.110 --> 38:02.130
He ruined a pawn of mine.

38:03.710 --> 38:06.090
Your victory today

38:06.110 --> 38:09.300
is absolutely crucial. Congratulations.

38:09.630 --> 38:12.170
Did I hurt my brother?

38:13.510 --> 38:14.690
You brothers

38:14.710 --> 38:17.380
will have plenty of time
to mend the bonds later.

38:17.400 --> 38:18.260
Right now, we must

38:18.280 --> 38:20.940
make good use of this victory.

38:21.110 --> 38:23.210
But I never meant to hurt him.

38:29.280 --> 38:32.170
Our actions this time

38:32.190 --> 38:34.300
concern the safety of the Dragon Clan

38:34.320 --> 38:36.860
and even the safety of the Three Realms.

38:38.630 --> 38:40.210
Is there truly no other way?

38:41.550 --> 38:43.010
Must I beat my brother?

38:44.360 --> 38:45.300
In today's battle,

38:45.630 --> 38:47.420
if you hadn't given it your all,

38:47.440 --> 38:48.610
you would've been hurt by him.

38:49.150 --> 38:50.170
On the battlefield, that's the rule.

38:50.840 --> 38:52.860
You either strike first,
or you get struck down.

38:53.590 --> 38:54.380
Your Highness.

38:55.000 --> 38:57.090
The strength and wisdom
you've shown today

38:57.510 --> 38:59.300
are nothing like the person I first met.

38:59.320 --> 39:01.900
You've changed completely.

39:01.920 --> 39:03.210
If Changgeng could see

39:03.320 --> 39:05.010
how much you've changed,

39:05.710 --> 39:07.090
he'd surely be happy for you.

39:14.920 --> 39:15.690
Right.

39:16.320 --> 39:18.300
I owe it all to the armor you gave me.

39:19.000 --> 39:19.780
What?

39:20.000 --> 39:20.780
I mean...

39:22.030 --> 39:23.570
This armor. You gave it to me.

39:24.710 --> 39:25.530
I did?

39:26.550 --> 39:28.050
That day, the maids
brought me some clothes.

39:28.070 --> 39:29.780
Hidden within them
was an armor sealed by power.

39:30.440 --> 39:32.210
Their cultivation was too weak
to see through it.

39:32.590 --> 39:33.780
They thought it was ordinary clothes

39:33.800 --> 39:34.690
and gave it to me.

39:36.960 --> 39:37.860
Did I?

39:38.280 --> 39:39.610
I must say, you human disciple

39:39.880 --> 39:41.490
are remarkably considerate.

39:41.550 --> 39:42.740
Thanks to your suit of armor,

39:43.030 --> 39:45.090
he would've been hurt today otherwise.

39:45.320 --> 39:46.860
This armor is a rare treasure indeed.

39:46.880 --> 39:47.900
Invulnerable to weapons.

39:48.070 --> 39:49.460
And you kept this from us?

39:49.480 --> 39:50.260
Playing it so safe.

39:50.760 --> 39:51.610
When that dragon

39:51.630 --> 39:53.380
had you pinned down,

39:53.510 --> 39:54.980
he was the one

39:55.000 --> 39:56.300
who told me to call out to you

39:56.510 --> 39:57.690
and tell you
to transform and fight back.

39:58.550 --> 39:59.900
Did I say that?

40:33.050 --> 40:38.830
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

40:39.500 --> 40:46.200
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

40:47.730 --> 40:53.780
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

40:54.410 --> 41:00.860
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

41:01.600 --> 41:08.720
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

41:09.100 --> 41:16.000
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

41:16.380 --> 41:23.730
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

41:23.730 --> 41:30.900
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

41:47.040 --> 41:52.210
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

41:53.300 --> 42:00.320
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

42:01.510 --> 42:07.450
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

42:08.150 --> 42:15.230
♪Alas, our story is short♪

42:15.570 --> 42:22.680
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:23.000 --> 42:29.480
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:30.260 --> 42:37.470
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:37.860 --> 42:45.680
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
